{'symbol': 'STE', 'date': '2022-07-28 16:30:00', 'title': 'STERIS RAISES DIVIDEND TO $0.47 PER SHARE', 'text': "DUBLIN, IRELAND, JULY 28, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \xa0STERIS PLC (NYSE: STE) (“STERIS” OR THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY WILL DISTRIBUTE A QUARTERLY INTERIM DIVIDEND OF $0.47 PER SHARE. THIS REPRESENTS A $0.04 INCREASE IN THE DIVIDEND AND THE COMPANY'S 17TH CONSECUTIVE YEAR OF DIVIDEND GROWTH."}